9.80665      g         - Gravitational acceleration (m/s^2) [default: 9.80665]
1025.0       rhoW      - Water density (kg/m^3) [default: 1025]
200.0        WtrDpth   - Water depth (m) [default: absent standalone; host-owned OpenFAST]
3.0e6        kBot      - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m) [default: 1.0e5]
